Original commit body from 3f895da:

Implements experiment 13.3 findings:

- Add multi-format README link extraction (Markdown, Org-mode, RST, AsciiDoc)
- Implement round-robin selection from README links, similarity, and centrality
- Add dynamic truncation based on median token count with 500-token floor
- Support reference-style Markdown links, Org [[url][text]], RST `text <url>`_
- Handle GitHub/GitLab Pages URLs and forge URLs (github.com, gitlab.com, etc.)
- Fix relative forge URL patterns (/repo/tree/branch/path) to skip branch name
- Handle Org-mode file: scheme links

The README always appears first in Additional Files. If it exceeds the budget,
it gets truncated and no other files are included. Otherwise, files are
selected in round-robin from: README-linked files, similarity-ranked files,
and centrality-ranked files.
